Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 07:52:42 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] test: cover debug-all IBD and concurrent transaction relay
 logging

Use three isolated regtest nodes, a 2000-block and 4000-transaction backlog, and 1000 independent transactions relayed from eight RPC connections. The framework requires zero dropped log lines at orderly shutdown. This checks bounded loopback correctness, not throughput or mainnet replay.

Full extended suite including this load case passed: 276 passed, 61 platform/disabled skips, zero failures. Combined source tree e61b616721b358d0d9336b41a2b52ae51b4475e5, unchanged throughout the 764.8-second run.
---
 test/functional/feature_logging_load.py | 93 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 93 insertions(+)
 create mode 100755 test/functional/feature_logging_load.py

diff --git a/test/functional/feature_logging_load.py b/test/functional/feature_logging_load.py
new file mode 100755
index 0000000000..16daeaaa8c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/test/functional/feature_logging_load.py
@@ -0,0 +1,93 @@
+#!/usr/bin/env python3
+# Copyright (c) 2026 The Lotus developers
